          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a POV first-person scene about skincare science.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with blue-hour ambient with a single warm practical for separation and grade to a filmic grade with halation on the specular highlights.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
